#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Operator backpropagation (OBP)"
msgstr "Instructions d'installation de la dernière version de la rétropropagation d'opérateurs (OBP)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Instructions d'installation"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Instructions d'installation {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the package, choose how you’re going to run and install the packages. There are two primary ways to do this:\n"
msgstr "Avant d'installer le paquet, choisis comment tu vas exécuter et installer les paquets. Il y a deux manières principales de le faire :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Option 1 : installer depuis PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Option 2 : installer depuis les sources](#option-2)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preinstallation {#preinstallation}"
msgstr "Préinstallation {#preinstallation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Commence par créer un environnement minimal contenant uniquement Python. Nous te recommandons d'utiliser des [environnements virtuels Python](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Active ton nouvel environnement.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: If you are using Windows, use the following commands in PowerShell:\n"
msgstr "Remarque : si tu utilises Windows, utilise les commandes suivantes dans PowerShell :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Option 1 : installer depuis PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-addon-obp` package is by using `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "La manière la plus simple d'installer le paquet `qiskit-addon-obp` est d'utiliser `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Option 2 : installer depuis les sources {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users who want to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally might want to install from source.\n"
msgstr "Les utilisateurs qui souhaitent développer dans le dépôt ou exécuter les notebooks en local voudront peut-être installer depuis les sources.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If so, the first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-obp` repository.\n"
msgstr "Dans ce cas, la première étape consiste à cloner le dépôt `qiskit-addon-obp`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Ensuite, mets à jour pip et place-toi dans le dépôt.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-obp` to the virtual environment. If you plan on running the notebooks, install the notebook dependencies so you can run visualizations. If you plan on developing in the repository, you might want to install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "L'étape suivante consiste à installer `qiskit-addon-obp` dans l'environnement virtuel. Si tu prévois d'exécuter les notebooks, installe les dépendances des notebooks afin de pouvoir exécuter les visualisations. Si tu prévois de développer dans le dépôt, tu voudras peut-être installer les dépendances `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Adapte les options ci-dessous à tes besoins.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs directory.\n"
msgstr "Si tu as installé les dépendances des notebooks, tu peux commencer en exécutant les notebooks du répertoire docs.\n"
